If it's on land,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} you can shake trees,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
dig holes in the ground,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} or even try
hitting rocks{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
If it's in the water,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} you can try to
fish or just dive right in!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}And if you keep looking to the skies,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
you might see one float by,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but only
if no one's visiting town.{{TAG:000F:0000:15000000}}
I got it!
...

ES:
Hay muchos sitios donde buscar
en el pueblo:{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} en el suelo,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}} en el mar,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}}
en el cielo...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
En tierra, por ejemplo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} puedes
sacudir los árboles,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} cavar hoyos
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}o hasta romper rocas{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
En el agua,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} puedes pescar o
zambullirte,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¡lo que tú veas!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}También puedes mirar al cielo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
por si hay alguno volando, cuando
no haya visitantes en el pueblo.{{TAG:000F:0000:15000000}}
Ya lo pillo
Esto...

IT:
Sai,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} in questa città{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} ci sono un sacco
di angoli dove cercare.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Nel terreno,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}}
nel mare,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}} su nel cielo...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Per esempio,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} puoi scuotere alberi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
scavare buche,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} oppure provare
a colpire le rocce con la pala{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
Se pensi che le uova siano nascoste
sott'acqua,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} prova a tuffarti,
oppure usa la canna da pesca!
Infine, se guardi in su verso il cielo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
potresti vedere un uovo volante,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ma solo se non hai visite in città!{{TAG:000F:0000:15000000}}
Ora ho capito!
...

DE:
Pass auf!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Zu dieser Stadt
gehören die Erde{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}}, das Meer{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}}
und der Himmel...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Auf der Erde gibt es Bäume zu
schütteln,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Löcher zu graben{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} und
Felsen abzuklopfen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
Das Wasser kannst du mit der Angel
oder durch Tauchen absuchen!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Und wenn du den Himmel im Auge
behältst,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} siehst du etwas fliegen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
wenn kein Besuch in der Stadt ist!{{TAG:000F:0000:15000000}}
Okay, verstanden.
